== 教材评注 ==
\begin{enumerate}
\item 关于定常线性系统的结构图

[LY] P27--30画了串联和并联的图,缺少反馈的图.

此处摘录[1]中2.5节的讲法:

结构图的基本组成单元是3种: 2个系统的串联,并联和反馈

记第$1$个系统的输入为$u_1$,输出为$y_1$,第$2$个系统的输入为$u_2$,输出为$y_2$,整个复合系统的输入为$u$,输出为$y$ (整个系统的传递函数即$\frac{\mathcal{L}[y(t)]}{\mathcal{L}[u(t)]}$)

串联: $u=u_1,y_1=u_2,y=y_2$

并联: $u=u_1=u_2,y=y_1+y_2$

反馈(第$2$个系统的输出反馈回第$1$个系统的输入): $u_1=u-y_2,u_2=y=y_1$

\item Chapter 5 of [LY]

Refer to pages 389--423 of [2], which discusses various problems related to minimum realization in detail.

\item Chapter 6 of [LY]

During class, a duality of controlled-invariant subspace and conditional-invariant subspace not mentioned in [LY] will be mentioned. Please refer to Chapters 4 and 5 of [3], which discuss these two types of subspaces in detail.

\item Chapter 7 of [LY]

If you are doing linear quadratic optimal control in a class of piecewise continuous functions rather than square-integrable functions, you can read [4].

\item About optimal control theory

[5] is an easy-to-read introductory lecture of more than 100 pages.

[6] is more detailed and easier to read than [YL].

[7] is a relatively detailed book with a suitable level of difficulty. The measurable choice problem of multivalued mappings is discussed in Chapter 2.

[8] provides some background knowledge on functional analysis and convex analysis.

[9], [10], and [11] are advanced monographs on optimal control theory. Things mentioned in class may appear in them.
\end{enumerate}

